    card from it (until the End Phase), then you can make this card gain ATK equal
    to that monster's ATK. If this Synchro Summoned card is sent to the GY: You can
    Special Summon this card, then you can apply this effect.\r\n\u25CF Look at your
    opponent's Extra Deck and banish (face-up) 2 cards from it until the End Phase.\r\nYou
    can only use each effect of \"Kewl Tune Crackle\" once per turn."
